<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-BRITISH LIONS BEAT GAUTENG LIONS 20-14.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-BRITISH LIONS BEAT GAUTENG LIONS 20-14.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The British Lions beat the Gauteng Lions (formerly Transvaal) 20-14 (halftime 3-9) in their rugby union tour match at Ellis Park on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
